## The starter contract

The app container (`{{appNode}}`) runs the image built from the starter's `Dockerfile` (called `calm-service` here; the
overlay names the image built for the service). It must listen on `$PORT` ({{servicePort}}) and answer `GET /health`.
It is told:

| Variable | Value |
|---|---|
